MicroLLM lab
============

This repository’s WebGPU harness, Q4 packer, and UI are original work for
this lab and are licensed under Apache-2.0.

It would not exist without PetitGPT.

  PetitGPT
  Author: yangqi0
  https://github.com/yangqi0/petitgpt
  License: Apache-2.0

  The research-v1 checkpoint, tokenizer, and transformer graph (pre-norm
  RMSNorm, fused QKV GQA, Llama-style RoPE, SwiGLU, tied embeddings) are
  the starting point of this port.

